            "review_title": "Review at Garbo Bar - Melia Hanoi",
            "review_text": "Ngoc Nguyen\n2 contributions\n0\nGreat experience.\nMay 2026 • Friends\nMelia Hanoi is the place to visit regularly every business trip, beautiful rooms, good service, clean. And yesterday I visited Garbo with my colleagues, and had the opportunity to enjoy some cocktails from Thailand introduced by my friend Oanh. The drinks were very good, the staff cared for the guests. My friends and I had a great time together. I will definitely come back many times later.\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten May 16, 2026",
