            "review_title": "Review at Garbo Bar - Melia Hanoi",
            "review_text": "Son Tung N\n37 contributions\n0\nFelt Truly Welcome at Melia Hanoi\nDec 2025 • Solo\nI had a really great stay at Melia Hanoi. The hotel is in a very central location, the room was clean and comfortable, and the service throughout the hotel was excellent.\n\nThe front desk team, especially Doan, Huong, and Quynh, were always friendly and helpful with anything I needed. Huy from the bell team was also very kind and patient.\n\nMy favorite part of the stay was definitely Garbo Bar. It became my go-to place in the evenings. Khang was fast and efficient, Manh was fun to talk to and taught me a bit about Vietnamese drinking culture, and Tinh shared some interesting stories from her many years at the hotel.\n\nA special thank you to Oanh, who made my stay even more memorable. She was incredibly sweet, warm, and welcoming. We talked a lot during my visit, and she always made me feel comfortable and at home. She was very attentive and often brought small snacks with my drinks. Her caring and genuine personality really stood out.\n\nThe staff at Melia Hanoi are what make this hotel so special. I would happily stay here again.\nRead more\nWritten May 11, 2026",
