            "review_text": "Philip G\nMinneapolis, Minnesota2064 contributions\n0\nGarbo is a Lovely Lobby Bar\nOct 2024 • Couples\nWe stopped at Garbo for an afternoon snack and a couple of drinks. Garbo is a lovely lobby bar in the underrated Melia Hanoi. While Garbo isn’t cheap, I felt we received our money’s worth. Service was professional, drinks were good, and the food served its purpose.\nWritten November 2, 2024",
